# Vendored upstream trees must be byte-identical on every clone.
#
# Git's line-ending normalisation would rewrite CRLF files on checkout —
# several boltons, semver and tabulate files ship with CRLF, and one of them
# is a test (tabulate's test_grapheme_clusters.py). Rewriting them would mean
# a judge validates a tree that differs from the one these results came from.
cases/** -text -diff

# The corpus is evidence, not source to review in a diff.
cases/** linguist-vendored
results/**.json -diff linguist-generated
trajectories/**.md -diff linguist-generated
